The way to use the pickaxe is to 'apply' it, and then dig in the direction of
the nearest room.  Keep doing this until you escape and get off that level
fast.  "You hear someone searching." means the guard is after you.  Of course,
the easiest way is to teleport out, or walk through the walls.

PS :: You can use the wand of polymorph on yourself, just choose "."(period)
as the direction option.

